# Forest spider on a wall (#483, D103): native 16x32 frames, head up, the wall on the right (feet on
# column 15). Mirrored for a wall on the left, flipped for a spider heading down. Same 12 colours as spider.grid.
# wall1, wall2: the climb (legs spread up and down the face, knees out, the belly against the wall); walltap: the notice
# on a wall (risen 1 px off the face, a foreleg drumming in the air), #483 (D103).
